    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκον-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>copy</i> from a pattern, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPar.</u>
				65.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draw up an official description,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFay.
				36.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mould into form</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀμόρφους ὕλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.10.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. ἀλήθειαν</span>
			<i>to give the semblance of</i> truth, <i><span class="en">
				Aphth.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				1
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>picture to oneself</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατον</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				226.19
			</span></i>.</div>
